// Source: NASA-TM-X-74335 / NOAA "U.S. Standard Atmosphere, 1976", Table 4
// (layer bases) and eqs. 33a/33b (pressure), 18 (geopotential). [Certain]
// Constants: g0 = 9.80665 m/s², R = R*/M0 = 8314.32/28.9644 = 287.05287 J/(kg·K),
// r0 = 6356766 m (effective Earth radius for geopotential conversion).
